      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It'd also help with local animations meant to hide things.\nThis way the mirror could ignore the animation and you could locally hide something while still being able to see it in the mirror.\n(Think non-head bone meshes blocking your view point.)\nIt'd also lessen the need for specific use case shaders as well as helping deal with mirror appearance discrepancies.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
